 "rules": [
  "The room plate reuses the online code plate's look (ink plate, 4px accent, bone code) at hero size: 4 cells of 72x92, the display role, one character centred per cell. The code entry field uses the same cell rects, so a code looks identical on both players' screens.",
  "Host: code_copied plays when the room code reaches the clipboard (on open and on X); the copy row shows the 'copied' state for 40 frames, then 'idle'.",
  "Guest: the same plate shows the code being joined, plate 'joining', and join_sweep loops under it until the server answers.",
  "B leaves the room (host) or cancels (guest): kit dialog_close-style exit, then back to ONLINE PLAY.",
  "When the opponent arrives: status 'connected' (online status_connected), opponent_found here, then the lobby opens after 45 frames."
 ],
